From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Seer: the settings page edits the download sources

The settings page gets the download sources, the Soulseek and Lidarr connections, the
Spotify credentials and the minimum free space. Each value saved there overrides the
.env value and applies without a restart. Keys are sent once and never shown again.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
